---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
const lastUpdated = "23 May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Data Policy"
  description="How ashmo.io handles submitted data, what users must not upload, and how confidential or sensitive information is treated."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Data"
    highlight="Policy."
    description={`How submitted data is handled and what users must not upload. Last updated: ${lastUpdated}.`}
    primary={{ href: '/privacy-policy/', label: 'Privacy policy' }}
    secondary={{ href: '/legal/', label: 'All legal pages' }}
    stats={[
      { value: '5', label: 'data classes' },
      { value: 'PDPL', label: 'aligned' },
      { value: '24h', label: 'review' },
    ]}
    sideEyebrow="Data handling"
    sideTitle="Users are responsible for what they submit. We minimise what we keep."
    sideDescription="Covers what we store, what users must never upload, classification, review, retention, and accidental confidential submissions."
  />

  <section class="section-shell pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] space-y-4">
      

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">01 · Purpose</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Purpose</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>This Data Policy explains what data ashmo.io stores, what users are not permitted to submit, how submitted data is classified and handled, and what happens when sensitive material is received unintentionally. It complements the <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">02 · What the Platform Stores</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">What the Platform Stores</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>Contact details voluntarily submitted via forms.</li>
            <li>Course or product purchase records.</li>
            <li>Consulting enquiry context shared in conversation.</li>
            <li>Newsletter subscription state.</li>
            <li>Analytics events (no personal identifiers).</li>
            <li>Audit logs for security and fraud prevention.</li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">03 · What Users Must Not Upload</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">What Users Must Not Upload</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p class="mb-3">Do <strong>not</strong> upload, paste, share, or transmit to ashmo.io any of the following unless you own them or have written legal permission to share them:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Confidential employer information.</li>
            <li>Trade secrets of any company.</li>
            <li>Private customer or client databases.</li>
            <li>Financial reports, P&amp;L statements, or unpublished commercial figures.</li>
            <li>Signed or draft contracts of third parties.</li>
            <li>Payroll, salary, or employee personal data.</li>
            <li>Supplier or vendor agreements.</li>
            <li>Recipes, formulations, or production specifications.</li>
            <li>Franchise manuals, operations manuals, or SOPs.</li>
            <li>Internal strategy decks, board materials, or M&amp;A material.</li>
            <li>Any document marked "Confidential", "Internal", "Restricted", or equivalent.</li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">04 · User Responsibility for Submitted Data</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">User Responsibility for Submitted Data</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>You are solely responsible for the lawfulness, accuracy, and ownership of any material you submit. By submitting data you confirm you have the right to share it. Ashmo accepts no liability for confidentiality breaches caused by user submissions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">05 · Review of Submitted Data</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Review of Submitted Data</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Submissions may be reviewed manually by Ashraf Hassan or a small operations team for the purpose of responding to the request, identifying potential misuse, and ensuring nothing prohibited has been shared.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">06 · Internal Data Classification</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Internal Data Classification</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>All submitted data is classified into one of five tiers:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
            <li><strong>Public</strong> — content the user has authorised for publication.</li>
            <li><strong>Internal</strong> — operational data used to deliver the service.</li>
            <li><strong>Confidential</strong> — limited-access data such as purchase records.</li>
            <li><strong>Highly Confidential</strong> — sensitive personal or financial detail; access tightly restricted.</li>
            <li><strong>Restricted</strong> — material that should not have been shared; quarantined and addressed under Section 8.</li>
          </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">07 · Retention and Deletion</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Retention and Deletion</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Submitted data is retained only as long as needed to complete the conversation or transaction, or as required by law. To request deletion, email <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">08 · Accidental Confidential Submissions</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Accidental Confidential Submissions</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>If material is submitted that appears confidential, proprietary, or sensitive — including content that may belong to a third party — we will:</p>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
            <li>Stop processing the material immediately.</li>
            <li>Quarantine it from working systems.</li>
            <li>Notify the sender and ask whether the material should be deleted, returned, or escalated.</li>
            <li>Delete the material on request, or by default within 30 days unless legal preservation applies.</li>
          </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">09 · Data Minimisation</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Data Minimisation</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>We collect the minimum data needed to do the job. We do not request information we do not need. We do not ask users for confidential employer or client information at any point.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">10 · Third-Party Tools</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Third-Party Tools</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>Some submitted data may be processed by trusted third-party tools (email, CRM, payment processing). See the <a href="/privacy-policy/#third-party-processors" class="text-accent hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> for the full list and safeguards.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

        <article class="card-base gradient-border p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <p class="mono-label">11 · Reporting Concerns</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.15rem] md:text-[1.3rem] font-bold leading-[1.2] text-text">Reporting Concerns</h2>
          <div class="mt-5 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.78] text-text-secondary space-y-3 [&_a]:text-accent [&_a:hover]:underline [&_strong]:text-text [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-1 [&_ol]:list-decimal [&_ol]:pl-6 [&_ol]:space-y-2 [&_blockquote]:border-l-2 [&_blockquote]:border-accent/40 [&_blockquote]:pl-4 [&_blockquote]:italic">
            <p>To report a data concern or request a review of submitted material: <a href="mailto:hello@ashmo.io" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@ashmo.io</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
